  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Justice and Stability in the Sahel (JASS) Phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JASS contributes to improving security and stability in the Sahel by improving equitable and inclusive land, natural resource governance and justice outcomes for marginalised communities in Mali and Niger. The programme invests in: (i) improving conflict management capacity and collaboration among communities divided by conflict, and between them and state institutions; (ii) strengthening resilience to climate shocks among affected communities in the target areas; and (iii) improving evidence base for effective delivery of stabilisation programmes to achieve growth, stability, and poverty reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
